title: File built in the browser (HTML smuggling)
severity: high
score: 60
tags: smuggling, malware-download
attack: T1027.006, T1204.002
description: The page built a large Blob/File and a risky file download happened in the same
  session: HTML smuggling that assembles the payload in the browser.
---
// A Blob built in the page ...
blobs
// ... and an executable, disguised or archive download.
| where exists(executable_downloads) or exists(disguised_downloads) or exists(archive_downloads)
| project type, size
